[{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/qwen-tts","label":"DASHSCOPE","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/qwen-tts\" label=\"DASHSCOPE\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-Demo","label":"HUGGING FACE DEMO","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-Demo\" label=\"HUGGING FACE DEMO\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://modelscope.cn/studios/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-Demo","label":"MODELSCOPE DEMO","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://modelscope.cn/studios/Qwen/Qwen3-TTS-Demo\" label=\"MODELSCOPE DEMO\" external=true >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"**Qwen3-TTS-Flash** is a flagship text-to-speech model that supports multi-timbre, multi-lingual, and multi-dialect speech synthesis. It aims to produce natural and expressive speech and is available via [Qwen API](https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/qwen-tts).","text":"**Qwen3-TTS-Flash** is a flagship text-to-speech model that supports multi-timbre, multi-lingual, and multi-dialect speech synthesis. It aims to produce natural and expressive speech and is available via [Qwen API](https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/qwen-tts).","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-TTS-Flash**","text":"Qwen3-TTS-Flash","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-TTS-Flash","text":"Qwen3-TTS-Flash","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" is a flagship text-to-speech model that supports multi-timbre, multi-lingual, and multi-dialect speech synthesis. It aims to produce natural and expressive speech and is available via ","text":" is a flagship text-to-speech model that supports multi-timbre, multi-lingual, and multi-dialect speech synthesis. It aims to produce natural and expressive speech and is available via ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"[Qwen API](https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/qwen-tts)","href":"https://help.aliyun.com/zh/model-studio/qwen-tts","title":null,"text":"Qwen API","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen API","text":"Qwen API","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":".","text":".","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Key Features:","text":"Key Features:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Key Features:","text":"Key Features:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"* **Excellent Chinese-English Stability**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA performance in Chinese and English stability on seed-tts-eval test set, surpassing SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.\n\n* **Superior Multilingual Performance**: In terms of multilingual stability and timbre similarity, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, significantly lower than MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Speaker similarity in English, Italian, and French also significantly surpasses MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.\n\n* **High Expressiveness**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash delivers highly expressive and human-like voice timbres, providing stable and reliable speech output that faithfully follows the input text.\n\n* **Rich Timbres and Languages**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash offers 17 distinct speaker options, each supporting 10 languages.\n\n* **Multi-dialect Support**:  Qwen3-TTS-Flash supports dialect generation, including Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.\n\n* **Tone Adaptation**: Trained on large-scale datasets, Qwen3-TTS-Flash can automatically adjust tone to match the input text.\n\n* **Strong Robust**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash automatically processes complex texts by extracting key information, demonstrating robustness to complex and diverse formats.\n\n* **Fast Generation**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash has very low first-packet latency with single-threaded first-packet latency as low as 97ms.","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":true,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Excellent Chinese-English Stability**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA performance in Chinese and English stability on seed-tts-eval test set, surpassing SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Excellent Chinese-English Stability**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA performance in Chinese and English stability on seed-tts-eval test set, surpassing SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Excellent Chinese-English Stability**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA performance in Chinese and English stability on seed-tts-eval test set, surpassing SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.\n","text":"**Excellent Chinese-English Stability**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA performance in Chinese and English stability on seed-tts-eval test set, surpassing SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Excellent Chinese-English Stability**","text":"Excellent Chinese-English Stability","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Excellent Chinese-English Stability","text":"Excellent Chinese-English Stability","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA performance in Chinese and English stability on seed-tts-eval test set, surpassing SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.","text":": Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA performance in Chinese and English stability on seed-tts-eval test set, surpassing SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Superior Multilingual Performance**: In terms of multilingual stability and timbre similarity, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, significantly lower than MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Speaker similarity in English, Italian, and French also significantly surpasses MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Superior Multilingual Performance**: In terms of multilingual stability and timbre similarity, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, significantly lower than MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Speaker similarity in English, Italian, and French also significantly surpasses MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Superior Multilingual Performance**: In terms of multilingual stability and timbre similarity, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, significantly lower than MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Speaker similarity in English, Italian, and French also significantly surpasses MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.\n","text":"**Superior Multilingual Performance**: In terms of multilingual stability and timbre similarity, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, significantly lower than MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Speaker similarity in English, Italian, and French also significantly surpasses MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Superior Multilingual Performance**","text":"Superior Multilingual Performance","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Superior Multilingual Performance","text":"Superior Multilingual Performance","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": In terms of multilingual stability and timbre similarity, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, significantly lower than MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Speaker similarity in English, Italian, and French also significantly surpasses MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.","text":": In terms of multilingual stability and timbre similarity, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, significantly lower than MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Speaker similarity in English, Italian, and French also significantly surpasses MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **High Expressiveness**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash delivers highly expressive and human-like voice timbres, providing stable and reliable speech output that faithfully follows the input text.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**High Expressiveness**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash delivers highly expressive and human-like voice timbres, providing stable and reliable speech output that faithfully follows the input text.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**High Expressiveness**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash delivers highly expressive and human-like voice timbres, providing stable and reliable speech output that faithfully follows the input text.\n","text":"**High Expressiveness**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash delivers highly expressive and human-like voice timbres, providing stable and reliable speech output that faithfully follows the input text.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**High Expressiveness**","text":"High Expressiveness","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"High Expressiveness","text":"High Expressiveness","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-TTS-Flash delivers highly expressive and human-like voice timbres, providing stable and reliable speech output that faithfully follows the input text.","text":": Qwen3-TTS-Flash delivers highly expressive and human-like voice timbres, providing stable and reliable speech output that faithfully follows the input text.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Rich Timbres and Languages**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash offers 17 distinct speaker options, each supporting 10 languages.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Rich Timbres and Languages**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash offers 17 distinct speaker options, each supporting 10 languages.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Rich Timbres and Languages**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash offers 17 distinct speaker options, each supporting 10 languages.\n","text":"**Rich Timbres and Languages**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash offers 17 distinct speaker options, each supporting 10 languages.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Rich Timbres and Languages**","text":"Rich Timbres and Languages","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Rich Timbres and Languages","text":"Rich Timbres and Languages","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-TTS-Flash offers 17 distinct speaker options, each supporting 10 languages.","text":": Qwen3-TTS-Flash offers 17 distinct speaker options, each supporting 10 languages.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Multi-dialect Support**:  Qwen3-TTS-Flash supports dialect generation, including Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Multi-dialect Support**:  Qwen3-TTS-Flash supports dialect generation, including Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Multi-dialect Support**:  Qwen3-TTS-Flash supports dialect generation, including Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.\n","text":"**Multi-dialect Support**:  Qwen3-TTS-Flash supports dialect generation, including Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Multi-dialect Support**","text":"Multi-dialect Support","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Multi-dialect Support","text":"Multi-dialect Support","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":":  Qwen3-TTS-Flash supports dialect generation, including Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.","text":":  Qwen3-TTS-Flash supports dialect generation, including Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Tone Adaptation**: Trained on large-scale datasets, Qwen3-TTS-Flash can automatically adjust tone to match the input text.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Tone Adaptation**: Trained on large-scale datasets, Qwen3-TTS-Flash can automatically adjust tone to match the input text.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Tone Adaptation**: Trained on large-scale datasets, Qwen3-TTS-Flash can automatically adjust tone to match the input text.\n","text":"**Tone Adaptation**: Trained on large-scale datasets, Qwen3-TTS-Flash can automatically adjust tone to match the input text.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Tone Adaptation**","text":"Tone Adaptation","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Tone Adaptation","text":"Tone Adaptation","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Trained on large-scale datasets, Qwen3-TTS-Flash can automatically adjust tone to match the input text.","text":": Trained on large-scale datasets, Qwen3-TTS-Flash can automatically adjust tone to match the input text.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Strong Robust**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash automatically processes complex texts by extracting key information, demonstrating robustness to complex and diverse formats.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Strong Robust**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash automatically processes complex texts by extracting key information, demonstrating robustness to complex and diverse formats.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Strong Robust**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash automatically processes complex texts by extracting key information, demonstrating robustness to complex and diverse formats.\n","text":"**Strong Robust**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash automatically processes complex texts by extracting key information, demonstrating robustness to complex and diverse formats.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Strong Robust**","text":"Strong Robust","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Strong Robust","text":"Strong Robust","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-TTS-Flash automatically processes complex texts by extracting key information, demonstrating robustness to complex and diverse formats.","text":": Qwen3-TTS-Flash automatically processes complex texts by extracting key information, demonstrating robustness to complex and diverse formats.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Fast Generation**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash has very low first-packet latency with single-threaded first-packet latency as low as 97ms.","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Fast Generation**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash has very low first-packet latency with single-threaded first-packet latency as low as 97ms.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Fast Generation**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash has very low first-packet latency with single-threaded first-packet latency as low as 97ms.","text":"**Fast Generation**: Qwen3-TTS-Flash has very low first-packet latency with single-threaded first-packet latency as low as 97ms.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Fast Generation**","text":"Fast Generation","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Fast Generation","text":"Fast Generation","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Qwen3-TTS-Flash has very low first-packet latency with single-threaded first-packet latency as low as 97ms.","text":": Qwen3-TTS-Flash has very low first-packet latency with single-threaded first-packet latency as low as 97ms.","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<body class=\"body\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MC6s4TLwX0A\"\n      style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 900px; height: 510px; \"\n      allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n      allowfullscreen>\n    </iframe>\n  </div>\n</body>\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<body class=\"body\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MC6s4TLwX0A\"\n      style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; width: 900px; height: 510px; \"\n      allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"\n      allowfullscreen>\n    </iframe>\n  </div>\n</body>\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Samples\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Samples","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Samples","text":"Samples","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Here are some multilingual samples by a single speaker: ","text":"Here are some multilingual samples by a single speaker: ","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Here are some multilingual samples by a single speaker: ","text":"Here are some multilingual samples by a single speaker: ","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"table","raw":"| Speaker | Language     | Text                                                                                                                                                                                                                     | Sample                                                                                                                                                      |\n|---------|--------------|-----------------|----------------|\n| Cherry  | Chinese      | 是呀！他们家的蜂蜜薰衣草拿铁超级超级好喝，一口下去，简直像喝了一口阳光。                                                                                                                                                | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>               |\n| Cherry  | English      | Absolutely! How about their honey lavender latte? It's like sunshine in a cup.                                                                                                                                           | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>               |\n| Cherry  | Japanese     | もちろん、ぜひ！ハニーラベンダーラテは、まるで晴れた日の公園にいるような、心がほぐれる一杯です。                                                                                                                         | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>               |\n| Cherry  | Korean       | 당연하죠! 허니 라벤더 라테는 어떠신가요? 마시는 순간 따스한 햇빛이 입 안 가득 퍼지는 느낌이에요.                                                                                                                         | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>               |\n| Cherry  | German       | Natürlich! Der Honig-Lavendel-Latte dort – ein wahrer Sonnenschein im Becher, der glücklich macht.                                                                                                                       | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>               |\n| Cherry  | Italian      | Ma certo! Il loro latte al miele e fiori di lavanda? È come bere un’alba tiepida e luminosa. E il dolce a spirale alla cannella va assolutamente provato – è così irresistibile che molti avventori, mentre lo savorano, si trasformano in poeti improvvisati. | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>               |\n| Cherry  | Portuguese   | Sem dúvida! O que acha do latte de mel e lavanda deles? É como beber felicidade dourada — um verdadeiro raio de sol aquecendo a alma.                                                                                     | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>               |\n| Cherry  | Spanish      | Sin duda. Un sorbo de café de miel y lavanda, y el sol entra en tu taza.                                                                                                                                                 | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line8.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>               |\n| Cherry  | French       | Bien sûr ! Et si vous essayiez leur latte au miel et à la lavande ? C’est comme boire un rayon de soleil dans une tasse.                                                                                                | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line9.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>               |\n| Cherry  | Russian      | Верно? Мне особенно нравятся такие супермаркеты, особенно во время Нового года. Ходить по супермаркету — это приносит мне невероятную, просто бешеную радость. Как только начинаю что-то покупать, покупаю сразу очень-очень много: и это хочется взять, и то тоже, и в итоге уношу домой целую кучу вещей. | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line10.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>              |\n\n\n","header":[{"text":"Speaker","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Speaker","text":"Speaker","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Language","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Language","text":"Language","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Text","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Text","text":"Text","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Sample","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Sample","text":"Sample","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null}],"align":[null,null,null,null],"rows":[[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Chinese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Chinese","text":"Chinese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"是呀！他们家的蜂蜜薰衣草拿铁超级超级好喝，一口下去，简直像喝了一口阳光。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"是呀！他们家的蜂蜜薰衣草拿铁超级超级好喝，一口下去，简直像喝了一口阳光。","text":"是呀！他们家的蜂蜜薰衣草拿铁超级超级好喝，一口下去，简直像喝了一口阳光。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"English","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"English","text":"English","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Absolutely! How about their honey lavender latte? It's like sunshine in a cup.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Absolutely! How about their honey lavender latte? It's like sunshine in a cup.","text":"Absolutely! How about their honey lavender latte? It's like sunshine in a cup.","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Japanese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Japanese","text":"Japanese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"もちろん、ぜひ！ハニーラベンダーラテは、まるで晴れた日の公園にいるような、心がほぐれる一杯です。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"もちろん、ぜひ！ハニーラベンダーラテは、まるで晴れた日の公園にいるような、心がほぐれる一杯です。","text":"もちろん、ぜひ！ハニーラベンダーラテは、まるで晴れた日の公園にいるような、心がほぐれる一杯です。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Korean","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Korean","text":"Korean","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"당연하죠! 허니 라벤더 라테는 어떠신가요? 마시는 순간 따스한 햇빛이 입 안 가득 퍼지는 느낌이에요.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"당연하죠! 허니 라벤더 라테는 어떠신가요? 마시는 순간 따스한 햇빛이 입 안 가득 퍼지는 느낌이에요.","text":"당연하죠! 허니 라벤더 라테는 어떠신가요? 마시는 순간 따스한 햇빛이 입 안 가득 퍼지는 느낌이에요.","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"German","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"German","text":"German","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Natürlich! Der Honig-Lavendel-Latte dort – ein wahrer Sonnenschein im Becher, der glücklich macht.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Natürlich! Der Honig-Lavendel-Latte dort – ein wahrer Sonnenschein im Becher, der glücklich macht.","text":"Natürlich! Der Honig-Lavendel-Latte dort – ein wahrer Sonnenschein im Becher, der glücklich macht.","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Italian","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Italian","text":"Italian","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Ma certo! Il loro latte al miele e fiori di lavanda? È come bere un’alba tiepida e luminosa. E il dolce a spirale alla cannella va assolutamente provato – è così irresistibile che molti avventori, mentre lo savorano, si trasformano in poeti improvvisati.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Ma certo! Il loro latte al miele e fiori di lavanda? È come bere un’alba tiepida e luminosa. E il dolce a spirale alla cannella va assolutamente provato – è così irresistibile che molti avventori, mentre lo savorano, si trasformano in poeti improvvisati.","text":"Ma certo! Il loro latte al miele e fiori di lavanda? È come bere un’alba tiepida e luminosa. E il dolce a spirale alla cannella va assolutamente provato – è così irresistibile che molti avventori, mentre lo savorano, si trasformano in poeti improvvisati.","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Portuguese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Portuguese","text":"Portuguese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Sem dúvida! O que acha do latte de mel e lavanda deles? É como beber felicidade dourada — um verdadeiro raio de sol aquecendo a alma.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Sem dúvida! O que acha do latte de mel e lavanda deles? É como beber felicidade dourada — um verdadeiro raio de sol aquecendo a alma.","text":"Sem dúvida! O que acha do latte de mel e lavanda deles? É como beber felicidade dourada — um verdadeiro raio de sol aquecendo a alma.","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Spanish","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Spanish","text":"Spanish","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Sin duda. Un sorbo de café de miel y lavanda, y el sol entra en tu taza.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Sin duda. Un sorbo de café de miel y lavanda, y el sol entra en tu taza.","text":"Sin duda. Un sorbo de café de miel y lavanda, y el sol entra en tu taza.","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line8.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line8.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line8.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"French","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"French","text":"French","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Bien sûr ! Et si vous essayiez leur latte au miel et à la lavande ? C’est comme boire un rayon de soleil dans une tasse.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Bien sûr ! Et si vous essayiez leur latte au miel et à la lavande ? C’est comme boire un rayon de soleil dans une tasse.","text":"Bien sûr ! Et si vous essayiez leur latte au miel et à la lavande ? C’est comme boire un rayon de soleil dans une tasse.","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line9.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line9.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line9.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Russian","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Russian","text":"Russian","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Верно? Мне особенно нравятся такие супермаркеты, особенно во время Нового года. Ходить по супермаркету — это приносит мне невероятную, просто бешеную радость. Как только начинаю что-то покупать, покупаю сразу очень-очень много: и это хочется взять, и то тоже, и в итоге уношу домой целую кучу вещей.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Верно? Мне особенно нравятся такие супермаркеты, особенно во время Нового года. Ходить по супермаркету — это приносит мне невероятную, просто бешеную радость. Как только начинаю что-то покупать, покупаю сразу очень-очень много: и это хочется взять, и то тоже, и в итоге уношу домой целую кучу вещей.","text":"Верно? Мне особенно нравятся такие супермаркеты, особенно во время Нового года. Ходить по супермаркету — это приносит мне невероятную, просто бешеную радость. Как только начинаю что-то покупать, покупаю сразу очень-очень много: и это хочется взять, и то тоже, и в итоге уношу домой целую кучу вещей.","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line10.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line10.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/单人多语/line10.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}]]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Here are some samples by Chinese and English speakers:","text":"Here are some samples by Chinese and English speakers:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Here are some samples by Chinese and English speakers:","text":"Here are some samples by Chinese and English speakers:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"table","raw":"| Speaker   | Language | Text                                                                                                                                                             | Sample                                                                                                                               |\n|-----------|----------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Cherry    | Chinese  | 唉呀，别担心嘛，养猫其实没有那么难的。只要多花点心思，慢慢的话就会得心应手哒。                                                                                         | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n| Nofish    | Chinese  | 好啊好啊，我跟你讲一下，你看，哇，这草地上好多学弟学妹在谈恋爱诶，你看，图书馆，哇太卷了吧，这些学姐肯定在写论文，对咯你看，那边宿舍区还在发气球哦。                                         | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n| Elias     | Chinese  | 来，同学们看这个x²+5x+6啊，我们说要拆成两个括号相乘。那么关键是什么呢？就是找两个数，加起来等于5，乘起来等于6。哎，2和3是不是正好？所以写成(x+2)(x+3)，这就叫因式分解，明白吧？                             | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n| Ethan     | Chinese  | 自动化？我帮你讲一讲，那些大哥哥消息很慢。厂里面要把那种轰隆隆的老机器换成自己会动的铁盒子，然后呢，办公室的叔叔们每晚都在吵架，哎，听了都快烦死了。                                                 | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n| Ryan      | English  | Interested in high-quality AI speech? Navigate to https://chat.qwen.ai for an instant preview.                                                                   | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n| Jennifer  | English  | Stress me out? It's freaking me out!  I don't even know what's going on anymore! It's like  I'm stuck in this tornado of thoughts.  Should I be calm? Should I be excited?  Should I be careful? Ugh!  I can't believe I'm even talking about this! This much money, it's just  so overwhelming! I feel like I'm drowning in it. | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n| katerina  | English  | Oh! The blue crabs? They're... uh... enthusiastic participants? I mean, technically, they're supposed to... uh, stabilize the substrate?                        | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n\n","header":[{"text":"Speaker","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Speaker","text":"Speaker","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Language","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Language","text":"Language","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Text","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Text","text":"Text","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Sample","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Sample","text":"Sample","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null}],"align":[null,null,null,null],"rows":[[{"text":"Cherry","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cherry","text":"Cherry","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Chinese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Chinese","text":"Chinese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"唉呀，别担心嘛，养猫其实没有那么难的。只要多花点心思，慢慢的话就会得心应手哒。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"唉呀，别担心嘛，养猫其实没有那么难的。只要多花点心思，慢慢的话就会得心应手哒。","text":"唉呀，别担心嘛，养猫其实没有那么难的。只要多花点心思，慢慢的话就会得心应手哒。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Nofish","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Nofish","text":"Nofish","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Chinese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Chinese","text":"Chinese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"好啊好啊，我跟你讲一下，你看，哇，这草地上好多学弟学妹在谈恋爱诶，你看，图书馆，哇太卷了吧，这些学姐肯定在写论文，对咯你看，那边宿舍区还在发气球哦。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"好啊好啊，我跟你讲一下，你看，哇，这草地上好多学弟学妹在谈恋爱诶，你看，图书馆，哇太卷了吧，这些学姐肯定在写论文，对咯你看，那边宿舍区还在发气球哦。","text":"好啊好啊，我跟你讲一下，你看，哇，这草地上好多学弟学妹在谈恋爱诶，你看，图书馆，哇太卷了吧，这些学姐肯定在写论文，对咯你看，那边宿舍区还在发气球哦。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Elias","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Elias","text":"Elias","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Chinese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Chinese","text":"Chinese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"来，同学们看这个x²+5x+6啊，我们说要拆成两个括号相乘。那么关键是什么呢？就是找两个数，加起来等于5，乘起来等于6。哎，2和3是不是正好？所以写成(x+2)(x+3)，这就叫因式分解，明白吧？","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"来，同学们看这个x²+5x+6啊，我们说要拆成两个括号相乘。那么关键是什么呢？就是找两个数，加起来等于5，乘起来等于6。哎，2和3是不是正好？所以写成(x+2)(x+3)，这就叫因式分解，明白吧？","text":"来，同学们看这个x²+5x+6啊，我们说要拆成两个括号相乘。那么关键是什么呢？就是找两个数，加起来等于5，乘起来等于6。哎，2和3是不是正好？所以写成(x+2)(x+3)，这就叫因式分解，明白吧？","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Ethan","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Ethan","text":"Ethan","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Chinese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Chinese","text":"Chinese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"自动化？我帮你讲一讲，那些大哥哥消息很慢。厂里面要把那种轰隆隆的老机器换成自己会动的铁盒子，然后呢，办公室的叔叔们每晚都在吵架，哎，听了都快烦死了。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"自动化？我帮你讲一讲，那些大哥哥消息很慢。厂里面要把那种轰隆隆的老机器换成自己会动的铁盒子，然后呢，办公室的叔叔们每晚都在吵架，哎，听了都快烦死了。","text":"自动化？我帮你讲一讲，那些大哥哥消息很慢。厂里面要把那种轰隆隆的老机器换成自己会动的铁盒子，然后呢，办公室的叔叔们每晚都在吵架，哎，听了都快烦死了。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Ryan","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Ryan","text":"Ryan","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"English","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"English","text":"English","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Interested in high-quality AI speech? Navigate to https://chat.qwen.ai for an instant preview.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Interested in high-quality AI speech? Navigate to ","text":"Interested in high-quality AI speech? Navigate to ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"https://chat.qwen.ai","text":"https://chat.qwen.ai","href":"https://chat.qwen.ai","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"https://chat.qwen.ai","text":"https://chat.qwen.ai"}]},{"type":"text","raw":" for an instant preview.","text":" for an instant preview.","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Jennifer","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Jennifer","text":"Jennifer","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"English","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"English","text":"English","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Stress me out? It's freaking me out!  I don't even know what's going on anymore! It's like  I'm stuck in this tornado of thoughts.  Should I be calm? Should I be excited?  Should I be careful? Ugh!  I can't believe I'm even talking about this! This much money, it's just  so overwhelming! I feel like I'm drowning in it.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Stress me out? It's freaking me out!  I don't even know what's going on anymore! It's like  I'm stuck in this tornado of thoughts.  Should I be calm? Should I be excited?  Should I be careful? Ugh!  I can't believe I'm even talking about this! This much money, it's just  so overwhelming! I feel like I'm drowning in it.","text":"Stress me out? It's freaking me out!  I don't even know what's going on anymore! It's like  I'm stuck in this tornado of thoughts.  Should I be calm? Should I be excited?  Should I be careful? Ugh!  I can't believe I'm even talking about this! This much money, it's just  so overwhelming! I feel like I'm drowning in it.","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"katerina","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"katerina","text":"katerina","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"English","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"English","text":"English","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Oh! The blue crabs? They're... uh... enthusiastic participants? I mean, technically, they're supposed to... uh, stabilize the substrate?","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Oh! The blue crabs? They're... uh... enthusiastic participants? I mean, technically, they're supposed to... uh, stabilize the substrate?","text":"Oh! The blue crabs? They're... uh... enthusiastic participants? I mean, technically, they're supposed to... uh, stabilize the substrate?","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/中英音色/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}]]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Here are some samples by dialect speakers:","text":"Here are some samples by dialect speakers:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Here are some samples by dialect speakers:","text":"Here are some samples by dialect speakers:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"table","raw":"| Speaker | Dialect    | Text                                                                                                                                                             | Sample                                                                                                                                |\n|---------|------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Dylan   | Beijing    | 哎呦喂，您猜怎么着儿？昨儿个我儿子给我带回一瓶儿二锅头，那叫一个香，美死我喽。                                                                                             | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>  |\n| Jada    | Shanghai   | 葛末也只好迭能了呀，昨日帮阿拉妈妈讲，要末挂个六千五百块，慢慢叫等？要末借拨中介，做搿种长租个公寓。                                                                                     | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>  |\n| Li      | Nanjing    | 你怎么晓得滴啊？半夜里头哦，这些花骨朵会泛青光，跟天河对岸滴织女星一唱一和滴。风一吹过去哦，花瓣子沙沙响，跟说悄悄话样滴。                                                                               | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>  |\n| Sunny   | Sichuanese | 对呀，而且还有那种逃生游戏哈，喔呦，我是试到下耍过我告了一哈我发现我不嘞行，因为我，它是这种沉浸式体验我耳机一戴，哇那个BGM一放，嗯，我完全整个人就沉浸在里面咯。                                                          | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>  |\n| Eric    | Sichuanese | 嘞家馆子哩菜味道简直巴适得板，吃起安逸惨咯。                                                                                                                                 | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>  |\n| Marcus  | Shaanxi    | 哎呀，你看这烂怂亭子！椽子都让虫咬成筛子咧，斡石墩缝里长滴全是蒿草，管事滴这些年光知道捞钱不修缮，气滴人牙痒痒！                                                                               | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>  |\n| Roy     | Hokkien    | 啊汝若去𨑨迌的时阵一定会紮三项物件是啥，除了手机仔佮，佮彼个，彼个，钱包欲按怎讲皮包仔啦，阮拢讲皮包仔乎，袂讲钱包。                                                                               | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>  |\n| Peter   | Tianjin    | 好么！您了可别瞎咧咧啦！没看见儿房檐儿滴水还带着青苔吗？老石板路让雨水泡得倍儿亮，柳树条子抽风塞的晃悠，介叫静中有动懂吗！                                                                               | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line8.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>  |\n| Rocky   | Cantonese  | 吓？踢波？今日我攰到成只狗咁啊！边有力踢波啫。不如打机算啦，稳阵啲咯。                                                                                                           | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line9.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>  |\n| Kiki    | Cantonese  | 你晨早去行山就最正啦，喺北门入口，跟住条青石板路一直上，啊见到樖“捩颈”松树咧就转右，沿住条溪边行十分钟左右咧，啲雾水未散嗰阵啊，仲会见到个洞口，会飘烟添啊！                                                               | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line10.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n\n","header":[{"text":"Speaker","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Speaker","text":"Speaker","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Dialect","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Dialect","text":"Dialect","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Text","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Text","text":"Text","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Sample","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Sample","text":"Sample","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null}],"align":[null,null,null,null],"rows":[[{"text":"Dylan","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Dylan","text":"Dylan","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Beijing","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Beijing","text":"Beijing","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"哎呦喂，您猜怎么着儿？昨儿个我儿子给我带回一瓶儿二锅头，那叫一个香，美死我喽。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"哎呦喂，您猜怎么着儿？昨儿个我儿子给我带回一瓶儿二锅头，那叫一个香，美死我喽。","text":"哎呦喂，您猜怎么着儿？昨儿个我儿子给我带回一瓶儿二锅头，那叫一个香，美死我喽。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Jada","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Jada","text":"Jada","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Shanghai","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Shanghai","text":"Shanghai","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"葛末也只好迭能了呀，昨日帮阿拉妈妈讲，要末挂个六千五百块，慢慢叫等？要末借拨中介，做搿种长租个公寓。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"葛末也只好迭能了呀，昨日帮阿拉妈妈讲，要末挂个六千五百块，慢慢叫等？要末借拨中介，做搿种长租个公寓。","text":"葛末也只好迭能了呀，昨日帮阿拉妈妈讲，要末挂个六千五百块，慢慢叫等？要末借拨中介，做搿种长租个公寓。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Li","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Li","text":"Li","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Nanjing","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Nanjing","text":"Nanjing","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"你怎么晓得滴啊？半夜里头哦，这些花骨朵会泛青光，跟天河对岸滴织女星一唱一和滴。风一吹过去哦，花瓣子沙沙响，跟说悄悄话样滴。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"你怎么晓得滴啊？半夜里头哦，这些花骨朵会泛青光，跟天河对岸滴织女星一唱一和滴。风一吹过去哦，花瓣子沙沙响，跟说悄悄话样滴。","text":"你怎么晓得滴啊？半夜里头哦，这些花骨朵会泛青光，跟天河对岸滴织女星一唱一和滴。风一吹过去哦，花瓣子沙沙响，跟说悄悄话样滴。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Sunny","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Sunny","text":"Sunny","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Sichuanese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Sichuanese","text":"Sichuanese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"对呀，而且还有那种逃生游戏哈，喔呦，我是试到下耍过我告了一哈我发现我不嘞行，因为我，它是这种沉浸式体验我耳机一戴，哇那个BGM一放，嗯，我完全整个人就沉浸在里面咯。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"对呀，而且还有那种逃生游戏哈，喔呦，我是试到下耍过我告了一哈我发现我不嘞行，因为我，它是这种沉浸式体验我耳机一戴，哇那个BGM一放，嗯，我完全整个人就沉浸在里面咯。","text":"对呀，而且还有那种逃生游戏哈，喔呦，我是试到下耍过我告了一哈我发现我不嘞行，因为我，它是这种沉浸式体验我耳机一戴，哇那个BGM一放，嗯，我完全整个人就沉浸在里面咯。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line4.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Eric","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Eric","text":"Eric","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Sichuanese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Sichuanese","text":"Sichuanese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"嘞家馆子哩菜味道简直巴适得板，吃起安逸惨咯。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"嘞家馆子哩菜味道简直巴适得板，吃起安逸惨咯。","text":"嘞家馆子哩菜味道简直巴适得板，吃起安逸惨咯。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line5.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Marcus","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Marcus","text":"Marcus","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Shaanxi","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Shaanxi","text":"Shaanxi","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"哎呀，你看这烂怂亭子！椽子都让虫咬成筛子咧，斡石墩缝里长滴全是蒿草，管事滴这些年光知道捞钱不修缮，气滴人牙痒痒！","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"哎呀，你看这烂怂亭子！椽子都让虫咬成筛子咧，斡石墩缝里长滴全是蒿草，管事滴这些年光知道捞钱不修缮，气滴人牙痒痒！","text":"哎呀，你看这烂怂亭子！椽子都让虫咬成筛子咧，斡石墩缝里长滴全是蒿草，管事滴这些年光知道捞钱不修缮，气滴人牙痒痒！","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line6.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Roy","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Roy","text":"Roy","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Hokkien","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Hokkien","text":"Hokkien","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"啊汝若去𨑨迌的时阵一定会紮三项物件是啥，除了手机仔佮，佮彼个，彼个，钱包欲按怎讲皮包仔啦，阮拢讲皮包仔乎，袂讲钱包。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"啊汝若去𨑨迌的时阵一定会紮三项物件是啥，除了手机仔佮，佮彼个，彼个，钱包欲按怎讲皮包仔啦，阮拢讲皮包仔乎，袂讲钱包。","text":"啊汝若去𨑨迌的时阵一定会紮三项物件是啥，除了手机仔佮，佮彼个，彼个，钱包欲按怎讲皮包仔啦，阮拢讲皮包仔乎，袂讲钱包。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line7.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Peter","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Peter","text":"Peter","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Tianjin","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Tianjin","text":"Tianjin","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"好么！您了可别瞎咧咧啦！没看见儿房檐儿滴水还带着青苔吗？老石板路让雨水泡得倍儿亮，柳树条子抽风塞的晃悠，介叫静中有动懂吗！","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"好么！您了可别瞎咧咧啦！没看见儿房檐儿滴水还带着青苔吗？老石板路让雨水泡得倍儿亮，柳树条子抽风塞的晃悠，介叫静中有动懂吗！","text":"好么！您了可别瞎咧咧啦！没看见儿房檐儿滴水还带着青苔吗？老石板路让雨水泡得倍儿亮，柳树条子抽风塞的晃悠，介叫静中有动懂吗！","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line8.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line8.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line8.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Rocky","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Rocky","text":"Rocky","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Cantonese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cantonese","text":"Cantonese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"吓？踢波？今日我攰到成只狗咁啊！边有力踢波啫。不如打机算啦，稳阵啲咯。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"吓？踢波？今日我攰到成只狗咁啊！边有力踢波啫。不如打机算啦，稳阵啲咯。","text":"吓？踢波？今日我攰到成只狗咁啊！边有力踢波啫。不如打机算啦，稳阵啲咯。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line9.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line9.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line9.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Kiki","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Kiki","text":"Kiki","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"Cantonese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Cantonese","text":"Cantonese","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"你晨早去行山就最正啦，喺北门入口，跟住条青石板路一直上，啊见到樖“捩颈”松树咧就转右，沿住条溪边行十分钟左右咧，啲雾水未散嗰阵啊，仲会见到个洞口，会飘烟添啊！","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"你晨早去行山就最正啦，喺北门入口，跟住条青石板路一直上，啊见到樖“捩颈”松树咧就转右，沿住条溪边行十分钟左右咧，啲雾水未散嗰阵啊，仲会见到个洞口，会飘烟添啊！","text":"你晨早去行山就最正啦，喺北门入口，跟住条青石板路一直上，啊见到樖“捩颈”松树咧就转右，沿住条溪边行十分钟左右咧，啲雾水未散嗰阵啊，仲会见到个洞口，会飘烟添啊！","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line10.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line10.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/方言音色/line10.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}]]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Here are some mixed multilingual samples:","text":"Here are some mixed multilingual samples:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Here are some mixed multilingual samples:","text":"Here are some mixed multilingual samples:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"table","raw":"| Speaker | Text                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             | Sample                                                                                                                               |\n|---------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Ethan   | 今天我穿了件新衬衫，朋友说：Wow！这衬衫很nice啊！\"我说：哈哈谢谢，这也是我的first impression。”他愣了一下，然后说：「これってダジャレ？」 我说：「아니요, 이건 first and last impression이에요. 셔츠가 너무 꽉 끼어서 더 못 입겠어요!」                                                                 | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n| Dylan   | 哎哟喂，您可算问着了！您瞅见西边儿那山尖儿没？At the moment the sun has just set, the old farmers are packing up their sickles and heading home. 路上啊碰见都相互招呼，\"¡Mañana a primera hora, corten la hilera del este!\"，嗓子啊都带着笑模样儿。                                                                 | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n| Kiki    | 哈哈哈，I'm really happy today! I know that girl from China, 佢成日都鍾意講：「多謝你，我會記得你對我嘅好。」用韓文講就係：고마워 기억할게 잘해줘서                                                                                                                                 | <audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio> |\n\n","header":[{"text":"Speaker","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Speaker","text":"Speaker","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Text","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Text","text":"Text","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Sample","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Sample","text":"Sample","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null}],"align":[null,null,null],"rows":[[{"text":"Ethan","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Ethan","text":"Ethan","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"今天我穿了件新衬衫，朋友说：Wow！这衬衫很nice啊！\"我说：哈哈谢谢，这也是我的first impression。”他愣了一下，然后说：「これってダジャレ？」 我说：「아니요, 이건 first and last impression이에요. 셔츠가 너무 꽉 끼어서 더 못 입겠어요!」","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"今天我穿了件新衬衫，朋友说：Wow！这衬衫很nice啊！\"我说：哈哈谢谢，这也是我的first impression。”他愣了一下，然后说：「これってダジャレ？」 我说：「아니요, 이건 first and last impression이에요. 셔츠가 너무 꽉 끼어서 더 못 입겠어요!」","text":"今天我穿了件新衬衫，朋友说：Wow！这衬衫很nice啊！\"我说：哈哈谢谢，这也是我的first impression。”他愣了一下，然后说：「これってダジャレ？」 我说：「아니요, 이건 first and last impression이에요. 셔츠가 너무 꽉 끼어서 더 못 입겠어요!」","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line1.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Dylan","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Dylan","text":"Dylan","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"哎哟喂，您可算问着了！您瞅见西边儿那山尖儿没？At the moment the sun has just set, the old farmers are packing up their sickles and heading home. 路上啊碰见都相互招呼，\"¡Mañana a primera hora, corten la hilera del este!\"，嗓子啊都带着笑模样儿。","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"哎哟喂，您可算问着了！您瞅见西边儿那山尖儿没？At the moment the sun has just set, the old farmers are packing up their sickles and heading home. 路上啊碰见都相互招呼，\"¡Mañana a primera hora, corten la hilera del este!\"，嗓子啊都带着笑模样儿。","text":"哎哟喂，您可算问着了！您瞅见西边儿那山尖儿没？At the moment the sun has just set, the old farmers are packing up their sickles and heading home. 路上啊碰见都相互招呼，\"¡Mañana a primera hora, corten la hilera del este!\"，嗓子啊都带着笑模样儿。","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line2.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}],[{"text":"Kiki","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Kiki","text":"Kiki","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"哈哈哈，I'm really happy today! I know that girl from China, 佢成日都鍾意講：「多謝你，我會記得你對我嘅好。」用韓文講就係：고마워 기억할게 잘해줘서","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"哈哈哈，I'm really happy today! I know that girl from China, 佢成日都鍾意講：「多謝你，我會記得你對我嘅好。」用韓文講就係：고마워 기억할게 잘해줘서","text":"哈哈哈，I'm really happy today! I know that girl from China, 佢成日都鍾意講：「多謝你，我會記得你對我嘅好。」用韓文講就係：고마워 기억할게 잘해줘서","escaped":false}],"header":false,"align":null},{"text":"<audio controls><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\"></audio>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<audio controls>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<audio controls>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/多语种混杂/line3.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">"},{"type":"html","raw":"</audio>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"</audio>"}],"header":false,"align":null}]]},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Language Support\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Language Support","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Language Support","text":"Language Support","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-TTS-Flash enables multilingual speech generation for multi speakers through a unified model:","text":"Qwen3-TTS-Flash enables multilingual speech generation for multi speakers through a unified model:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-TTS-Flash enables multilingual speech generation for multi speakers through a unified model:","text":"Qwen3-TTS-Flash enables multilingual speech generation for multi speakers through a unified model:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"* **Chinese**: Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.\n\n* **English**: British accent, American accent, and various regional English accents.\n\n* **Other Languages**: French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":true,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Chinese**: Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Chinese**: Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Chinese**: Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.\n","text":"**Chinese**: Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Chinese**","text":"Chinese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Chinese","text":"Chinese","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.","text":": Mandarin, Hokkien, Wu dialect, Cantonese, Sichuanese, Beijing dialect, Nanjing dialect, Tianjin dialect, and Shaanxi dialect.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **English**: British accent, American accent, and various regional English accents.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**English**: British accent, American accent, and various regional English accents.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**English**: British accent, American accent, and various regional English accents.\n","text":"**English**: British accent, American accent, and various regional English accents.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**English**","text":"English","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"English","text":"English","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": British accent, American accent, and various regional English accents.","text":": British accent, American accent, and various regional English accents.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Other Languages**: French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Other Languages**: French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Other Languages**: French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.","text":"**Other Languages**: French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Other Languages**","text":"Other Languages","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Other Languages","text":"Other Languages","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.","text":": French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Performance\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Performance","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Performance","text":"Performance","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We conducted a comprehensive evaluation of Qwen3-TTS-Flash in terms of speech stability and timbre similarity, and it achieves SOTA performance across many results. Specifically, on the seed-tts-eval test set, Qwen3-TTS-Flash demonstrates SOTA stability for both Chinese and English, outperforming SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Furthermore, on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French, significantly lower than those of MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. In terms of speaker similarity for English, Italian, and French, Qwen3-TTS-Flash also surpasses the aforementioned models, demonstrating remarkable performance in both multi-language stability and timbre similarity.","text":"We conducted a comprehensive evaluation of Qwen3-TTS-Flash in terms of speech stability and timbre similarity, and it achieves SOTA performance across many results. Specifically, on the seed-tts-eval test set, Qwen3-TTS-Flash demonstrates SOTA stability for both Chinese and English, outperforming SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Furthermore, on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French, significantly lower than those of MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. In terms of speaker similarity for English, Italian, and French, Qwen3-TTS-Flash also surpasses the aforementioned models, demonstrating remarkable performance in both multi-language stability and timbre similarity.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We conducted a comprehensive evaluation of Qwen3-TTS-Flash in terms of speech stability and timbre similarity, and it achieves SOTA performance across many results. Specifically, on the seed-tts-eval test set, Qwen3-TTS-Flash demonstrates SOTA stability for both Chinese and English, outperforming SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Furthermore, on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French, significantly lower than those of MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. In terms of speaker similarity for English, Italian, and French, Qwen3-TTS-Flash also surpasses the aforementioned models, demonstrating remarkable performance in both multi-language stability and timbre similarity.","text":"We conducted a comprehensive evaluation of Qwen3-TTS-Flash in terms of speech stability and timbre similarity, and it achieves SOTA performance across many results. Specifically, on the seed-tts-eval test set, Qwen3-TTS-Flash demonstrates SOTA stability for both Chinese and English, outperforming SeedTTS, MiniMax, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. Furthermore, on MiniMax TTS multilingual test set, Qwen3-TTS-Flash achieves SOTA WER for Chinese, English, Italian, and French, significantly lower than those of MiniMax, ElevenLabs, and GPT-4o-Audio-Preview. In terms of speaker similarity for English, Italian, and French, Qwen3-TTS-Flash also surpasses the aforementioned models, demonstrating remarkable performance in both multi-language stability and timbre similarity.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"http://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/table2.png#center","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"http://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/table2.png#center\" width=\"80%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n","pre":false,"text":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"http://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/table1.png#center","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"http://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-TTS-Flash/table1.png#center\" width=\"80%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n","pre":false,"text":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We introduce several architectural upgrades and acceleration strategies to achieve lower first-packet latency and faster generation speed.","text":"We introduce several architectural upgrades and acceleration strategies to achieve lower first-packet latency and faster generation speed.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We introduce several architectural upgrades and acceleration strategies to achieve lower first-packet latency and faster generation speed.","text":"We introduce several architectural upgrades and acceleration strategies to achieve lower first-packet latency and faster generation speed.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"table","raw":"| | Qwen3-TTS-Flash | Qwen-TTS |\n|---|---|---|\n| Concurrency | Dual-GPU 12 Concurrency | Dual-GPU 6 Concurrency |\n| First Packet Latency (Single Concurrency) | 97ms | 200ms |\n| First Packet Latency (Full Concurrency)） | 420ms | 733ms |\n| First Packet Size (Full Concurrency, larger is better) | 320ms | 190ms |\n| RTF (Single Concurrency) | 0.30 | 0.43 |\n| RTF (Full Concurrency) | 0.51 | 0.72 |\n\n","header":[{"text":"","tokens":[],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Qwen3-TTS-Flash","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-TTS-Flash","text":"Qwen3-TTS-Flash","escaped":false}],"header":true,"align":null},{"text":"Qwen-